{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"8689561a1d68136c740a9a4b160953ac7036bf97bcadccc1fba4da24724a113c","digest":{"component_or_area":"S3 ticket-store remote validation","key_entities":["src/rebar/_store/push.py","src/rebar/_commands/init.py","src/rebar/_optional.py","require_s3_helper()","_require_s3_helper_if_s3_url()","sync.remote","s3://","s3+zip://","OptionalDependencyError","push_tickets_branch","write_and_push","push_after_commit","_mount_or_create_branch","SyncConfig.remote"],"problem_keywords":["s3 remote","git-remote-s3 helper","missing dependency","fail closed","store corruption","locking mechanism","optional dependency"],"propositions":["An s3:// or s3+zip:// remote without a git-remote-s3 helper >= 0.3.2 causes silent store corruption by allowing multiple bundles per ref","Store operations (init and push) must fail early and closed when an S3-scheme remote is detected but the required helper is missing or too old","The preflight check _require_s3_helper_if_s3_url() detects S3 mode by URL scheme (s3:// or s3+zip://) and raises OptionalDependencyError unconditionally, overriding best-effort semantics","Non-S3 remotes and unresolvable remotes must not trigger the S3 preflight and must retain existing behavior","S3 mode detection uses existing remote URL resolution points (push.py line ~418 and init.py _git invocations) with no new config schema or gitutil helpers"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787536071582500001,"uuid":"eb296d98-e8c3-499b-b8f0-8d93c79e032e"}